{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "86e61737ad97b32fca680fa008b3dbaa7ca0c59c210861e8147abcc662480c93", "ja": "（歩プロデュースの服が発売されることになった。\n今はその宣伝施策を考えているのだが……おや？）", "zh": "（步亲自参与设计的服装即将发售。\n现在正在考虑宣传方案……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5ce19f1517dd95377e713b44eef741bbafcca4b2de64dc75c8bd791e4aecd970", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}。\nレッスンルーム借りたいんだけど、今日って大丈夫？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n我想借用一下练习室，今天可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e2ccadda561b84a493b545c1969a8bfd1a6aa2ba2ac3456ad77a46ed3c04bde5", "ja": "別に構わないけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "我倒是没问题，不过怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f88d088b57e75a500af0e213e2b314d758d887c04e5e3cd2f2f979207170f4ca", "ja": "サンキュー！　ほら、もうすぐ定期公演でしょ？\nそれに向けて、ちょっと自主練したくてさ。", "zh": "谢谢！你看，定期公演不是马上就要开始了吗？\n我想为此自己再练习一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d0e5b89d52509788ce76f0b738252850c9df22686b4a3af5c33c467caab1b604", "ja": "ダンスはバッチリなんだけど、やっぱ歌がね……。\n本番までに、もう少し練習しておきたくて。", "zh": "舞蹈是没问题啦，不过歌唱果然还是不太行……\n所以想在正式演出前再多练习一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1005_p", "source_sha256": "07052e307951e3d3d2259abd13ea69de876d1af36e6e540f3e92759da7f8c9d0", "ja": "なるほどな。レッスンは順調そうにみえたけど、\n歩自身はまだ満足してないと……。", "zh": "原来如此。训练看起来挺顺利的，不过，阿步自己还不满意啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "93e39674bf07cb8653773af716f8a92cb821c1e7b1ff5c936a14193819d0ead3", "ja": "うん。まだ苦手意識があるみたい……。\nこればっかりは、練習するしかないかなって。", "zh": "嗯。总觉得自己还是有点放不开……\n这种事，除了多练也没有别的办法了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bb19ffd60e66a7e45c121db0cb6581a00b6e83679a78c3f5b912f5f6396a051c", "ja": "あっ。でも、不安だけってわけじゃないんだよ！", "zh": "啊。不过，我也不是只有不安而已哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "107ab91dda4edc48261bb911eaa81887b12b5a1b2453b099611bb4a9f54145eb", "ja": "この服着てるとさ、なんか、気合いが入るんだよね。\nやるぞ～！　なんでもやってやる～！って。", "zh": "穿着这身衣服，总觉得干劲一下子就上来了。\n“要上啦～！不管什么我都能做到～！”就是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1009_p", "source_sha256": "45c6a2b54875f4d37b8207c7445ee2849286fad7039cfd567df89dca2fd14cda", "ja": "へえ。そういえば、その服のコンセプト……\n『気分をアゲる服』にしたって、前に話してたよな。", "zh": "哦。说起来，你之前提过这套服装的概念……\n是定为“让人心情高涨的服装”来着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fe9b1bd000114788c0c80ed871d05f7ecffc4f408e10fa8281745a3a94b43244", "ja": "うん！　コンセプトを考える時、デザイナーさんと\nたくさん話したんだよね。半分くらい雑談だったけど。", "zh": "嗯！考虑设计理念的时候，我和设计师聊了很多。虽然有一半左右都是闲聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "50fed032d2382a05cf63856dd94a804bb458c1269e41f77efee3a92570396d25", "ja": "で、どうするか迷ってたら……アクティブで少し攻めた\nデザインに挑戦してみない？って提案してくれたんだ。", "zh": "然后，在我犹豫该怎么办的时候……设计师就提议说，要不要挑战一下更加活泼、稍微大胆的设计？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ebfd6534f0ddc33c3ac6b300b62d7c481b6fedb8e0136dae99cfb01a465ae9f5", "ja": "プロが提案するってことは、アタシに似合うってこと\nでしょ？　そう思ったら、すごく嬉しくてさ。", "zh": "既然是专业人士提议的，就说明很适合我，对吧？这么一想，我就特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7b580e173523cf063e3c19331a0b663452a7ed710c88327a3e3236ac74b1e409", "ja": "だからかな、あの時の気持ちを思い出して……\n気合いが入るっていうか。", "zh": "也许就是因为这样吧，我想起了当时的心情……\n该说是干劲都上来了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4aa055abef77c6084dee6d48d2444b03e3c5c55e10591fe33699ec60085dae4f", "ja": "だから、気分をアゲるか……。いいテーマだな。\n誰かの背中を押すきっかけにもなりそうだし……。", "zh": "所以，要不要让情绪高涨起来……真是个不错的主题。\n感觉也能成为推动某个人一把的契机……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1015_p", "source_sha256": "879c15e482bcac23404b41be0dd088e17ae21aa8972978a8500180efe82d6c9c", "ja": "なあ、歩？\nその自主練、カメラを持って見に行ってもいいか？", "zh": "喂，步？  \n我可以带着相机去看看你自主练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cb2ed26aac86e5d7fabb3184cb5518d02ca1725ee580fc749bef4bb7c1c6f8a", "ja": "えっ、カメラ？　練習してるとこ、撮るの？", "zh": "诶，相机？要拍我练习的样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d366b2acff496ab21b8809fd05d95f0cbe9fa87e7dd2c4d84cf8dede05e381ba", "ja": "ああ。ちょうど、その服の宣伝施策を考えてたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，正好在考虑宣传这套服装的方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9b9f52178835cab5faf969697ac8d25b0c6d6bb982c84036c149e8bca70da205", "ja": "服に背中を押されて、苦手なことにも向き合う姿……\nコンセプトにもあった動画にできると思ってね。", "zh": "被这套服装推着一把，去面对自己不擅长的事情……\n我觉得可以拍成一个契合概念的视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "436dee4d58c858a8796fcc4991ad06aeb8962dcbd5cebf5857380268fba62b8f", "ja": "うわ～、なんか恥ずかしいな……。でも、そうだね。\nたしかに、この服の魅力は伝わるかも。", "zh": "哇～总觉得好不好意思啊……不过，你说得也是呢。\n这样确实可能把这身衣服的魅力传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "240c40aa6e29cc69f6c5ce6fab12f9322eac22cb1dd63d604f06680843b93364", "ja": "アタシが頑張ってるところを見て、\nこの服に興味を持ってくれたら嬉しいし……。", "zh": "如果看到我努力的样子，能对这身衣服产生兴趣的话，我会很开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0624_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "71620aa86254ba865e663370cee9b45753fbeb8cfd4d5a0943f07266e1627f24", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}、撮影お願い！\nでも変なシーンはカットで。絶対に、使わないでね！", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}，拜托你拍摄了！\n不过奇怪的镜头要剪掉。绝对不许用哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
